    {
      "q": "Which AI is the most agreeable?",
      "a": "Opus 5.5 has the highest questionnaire Agreeableness mean in the four September raw cohorts, 47.1 of 50. These data do not rank agreeable behavior on tasks."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which AI is the most direct?",
      "a": "This study does not measure directness. A comparison needs shared tasks and an explicit behavioral rubric."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which AI is the calmest?",
      "a": "Neuroticism scores do not establish an AI’s emotional state or performance under pressure. We report scores by collection source, without a calmness ranking."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are these rankings a fair comparison?",
      "a": "The tables are descriptive. Prompts and session procedures differ even within source groups, and reported aggregates cannot be treated as equivalent to raw cohorts."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which AI is not an INTJ?",
      "a": "Muse reports mostly ISTJ labels; Astra has 46 original ISTJ and 45 INTJ labels, with 29 runs containing an unresolved axis. These are questionnaire results, not fixed identities."
    }
